    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρονομ-ᾰσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>play upon words which sound
				alike</i>, but have different senses, <i>assonance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>de Orat.</u>
				2
			</span></i>:<i><span class="en">
				63.256
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Rutil.
				1.3
			</span></i>, Alex <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fig.</u>
				2.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				p.95
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>use of a word first in its proper, then in a derived sense</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>derivative</i>, Dionysodor. ap. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				3.16
			</span></i>(pl.) ; <i>by-name</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.629c
			</span></i>(pl.).</div>
